  ultimateText: "Nh\u01B0 \xDD Thi\xEAn Tr\u1EE5: g\u1EADy kh\u1ED5ng l\u1ED3 d\u1EADp
    n\u1EB1m ngang xu\u1ED1ng c\u1EE5m qu\xE1i \u0111\xF4ng nh\u1EA5t \u2014 s\xE1t
    th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\u1EDBn theo v\u1EC7t d\xE0i, cho\xE1ng 1,5s, v\u1EBFt n\u1EE9t
    l\xE0m ch\u1EADm 3s; m\u1ED7i ph\xE2n th\xE2n d\u1EADp g\u1EADy nh\u1ECF 30%."
  passiveText: "Th\u1EBF Th\xE2n \xB7 L\xF4ng V\u1EC1 Th\xE2n: l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u
    h\u1EBFt m\xE1u m\u1ED7i wave, m\u1ED9t ph\xE2n th\xE2n th\xE0nh b\u1EA3n th\u1EC3
    (40% m\xE1u); m\u1ED7i ph\xE2n th\xE2n tan h\u1ED3i 8% m\xE1u; h\xFAt m\xE1u
    10%."
  minorText: "Nh\u1ED5 L\xF4ng Ph\xE2n Th\xE2n: th\u1ED5i ra 2 ph\xE2n th\xE2n s\u1ED1ng
    8s (40% c\xF4ng/m\xE1u), t\u1EF1 \u0111\xE1nh, m\u1ED7i con ch\u1EB7n 3 qu\xE1i."
  secondMinorText: "To\xE0n Phong C\xF4n: xoay g\u1EADy 3s \u2014 \u0111\xE1nh quanh
    m\xECnh, ch\u1EB7n v\xE0 b\u1EADt ng\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EA1n; m\u1ED7i qu\xE1i
    tr\xFAng h\u1ED3i 3% m\xE1u (tr\u1EA7n 25%)."
